+# file, You can obtain one at http://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/.
+
+## GORILLA UNLEASHED - SATELLITE MODE (maintainer, 2026-10-04). English only (D-157-03).
+## Read by Settings (General, Network) and by the toolbar button next to the address bar
+## (browser/modules/GorillaLinkMode.sys.mjs), so both always say the same thing.
+
+gorilla-satellite-mode =
+    .label = Gorilla.Satellite mode
+    .description = For slow, far-away or expensive internet: satellite, Starlink, rural mobile, down to 5 KB per second. Nothing is sent anywhere; the browser fetches less and waits longer.
+gorilla-satellite-mode-off =
+    .label = Off: a normal connection
+    .description = The browser behaves as shipped.
+    .title = Use this on broadband, fibre and good mobile connections.
+gorilla-satellite-mode-satellite =
+    .label = Satellite: fast but far away (Starlink, satellite broadband)
+    .description = No autoplay, no video preloading, longer waits before giving up, pages kept on disk.
+    .title = For links that are fast but have a long delay, such as Starlink or geostationary satellite. Videos never start by themselves and are not downloaded in advance; the browser waits longer for slow servers instead of failing; addresses are remembered for 10 minutes; up to 256 MB of pages are kept on disk, so after a restart a page you already visited does not download everything again.
+gorilla-satellite-mode-very-slow =
+    .label = Very slow link: works down to 5 KB per second
+    .description = Everything in Satellite, plus no pictures, no web fonts, and sites are asked for lighter pages.
+    .title = For very slow or very expensive links, down to 5 KB per second. Everything in Satellite, plus: pictures are not downloaded (to see them on one site, press Ctrl+I, open Permissions and allow Load Images); websites keep their text but not their downloadable fonts; every request carries "Save-Data: on", which asks sites that support it for a lighter page; at most 6 connections per site, so they do not compete for the little bandwidth there is.
+
+## The toolbar button: its words show the level in use; a click opens the three levels above.
+
+gorilla-satellite-button =
+    .tooltiptext = Gorilla.Satellite mode: for slow, far-away or expensive internet, down to 5 KB per second. Click to choose a level; hover over a level for what it changes. Nothing is sent anywhere.
+gorilla-satellite-button-off =
+    .label = Gorilla.Satellite mode: Off
+gorilla-satellite-button-satellite =
+    .label = Gorilla.Satellite mode: Satellite
+gorilla-satellite-button-very-slow =
+    .label = Gorilla.Satellite mode: Very slow link
+gorilla-satellite-button-settings =
+    .label = Open Settings for Gorilla.Satellite mode
